From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 11:03:52 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] 1127 redfin: NFC persona answers per NXP OID (2F 03
 ConfigHsuBr = 1-byte status, 2F 19 GetFwInterfaceVersion 00 00 15, 2F 02
 EnableExtn +4, 2F 06 GetFwType +1), CRC16 trailer mirroring,
 kern.sweet_nfc_fwif_fmt variants, reply bytes in persona klog

---
 bsd/dev/sweet_nfc.c | 199 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++---
 1 file changed, 189 insertions(+), 10 deletions(-)

diff --git a/bsd/dev/sweet_nfc.c b/bsd/dev/sweet_nfc.c
index 7a317cf..92b719e 100644
--- a/bsd/dev/sweet_nfc.c
+++ b/bsd/dev/sweet_nfc.c
@@ -617,7 +617,8 @@ static LCK_MTX_DECLARE(p1_lock, &nfc_lock_group);
 static kern_ctl_ref gw_ctl;
 static uint32_t nfc_p1, nfc_gw_mode;
